{"t":"Hunter Camp","s":"hunter-camp-8ddd7","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Hunter_bbba27.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hunter Camp</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Hunter\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunter_bbba27.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">South-west in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32900,32792,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32900, 32792, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Hunter Camp</b> is a square area bordered by Bamboo Walls and doors in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> jungle located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32900,32792,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32900, 32792, 7)</a>, north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Tower\">Medusa Tower</a>. It is a camp where hunters bring the fur they collected from hunting. You may also come across their boss, <a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a>.\n</p><p>Sometimes, this camp won't be there and you will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Camp\">Dworc Camp</a> instead. This is because these camps make up the <a href=\"#/quest/jungle-camp-mini-world-change\">Jungle Camp Mini World Change</a> together.\n</p><p>There is a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Note Pinned on the Wall\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Note_Pinned_on_the_Wall_b65fb0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Note Pinned on the Wall of the main building, apparently written on behalf of boss Arthom:<br/>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">LISTEN UP: The boss says, no more running after those pesky dworcs! Just make sure they don't make off with our tanned furs and keep them far away from the camp. Burnning down their ritual sites should make sure they stay out of our hunting grounds. The boss will check on things personally today and take his share of furs and hides with him. Keep up the cooking and tanning rotas as before, and make also sure to kill every trespasser</span></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\"><img alt=\"Poacher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poacher_452ba2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poacher</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>Leather Helmet (common)</li>\n<li>1-18× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Legs\">Leather Legs</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Closed%20Trap\">Closed Trap</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\"><img alt=\"Hunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunter_bbba27.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-22× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Hunter's Quiver (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Orange</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Necklace\">Dragon Necklace</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer%20Trophy\">Deer Trophy</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sniper%20Gloves\">Sniper Gloves</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Trophy\">Lion Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Slingshot (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\">Wolf Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-And_sometimes\">And sometimes</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\"><img alt=\"Arthom the Hunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arthom_the_Hunter_aba02c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">550</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">150 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>Hunter's Quiver</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Sniper%20Arrow\">Sniper Arrow</a></li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a></li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a></li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a></li>\n<li>2-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a></li>\n<li>1-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sniper%20Gloves\">Sniper Gloves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Necklace\">Dragon Necklace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Armor\">Dark Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Talon\">Talon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Trophy\">Lion Trophy</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["jungle-camp-mini-world-change"]}